The Met | SABYASACHI 

The Met | Sabyasachi collaboration is an exploration of how culture travels, evolves, and endures, drawing from 5,000 years of history preserved within the collection of The Metropolitan Museum of Art in New York City.

For centuries, art, ornament, and craftsmanship have crossed borders through trade and cultural exchange. With each movement, new ideas of beauty and identity were shaped. 

Now, Sabyasachi reinterprets these shared histories through a contemporary lens, transforming historic design into modern creations. The result is a collection of modern heirlooms rooted in the past, crafted for today.

Launching at New York Fashion Week September 2026



