The Met | SABYASACHI 

History does not exist in fragments. It exists in a continuum.

In collaboration with The Metropolitan Museum of Art, inspired by 5,000 years of art and history, this collection reimagines cultural exchange of the Byzantine Empire through High Jewellery, transforming historic designs into modern heirlooms.

Launching at New York Fashion Week September 2026



